SUMMARY:Biweekly Filmmaker/Actor Meetup
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Filmmakers and Actors Group\nCome by if you want to 
 meet/network with fellow filmmakers and film actors in the Asheville area!
  Share what you're working on or just have a casual chat with local artist
 s.\n\nLook for the guy with the laminated paper sign that says "AVL Filmma
 kers and Actors Meetup".\n\nYou may need to park down the street and walk 
 to the Cafe.
